{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_fang_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_fang_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"二次衝鋒","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_fang_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"67b6c81efb797805ff9bb28b6ea0ebe3a5d1c9a32a62d0ddd68f01c70ddb3180","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"芬對自己首次作為正式作戰小隊隊長出現的指揮上的失誤十分懊惱。好在，她願意向隊員們尋求幫助，而大家樂於幫她化解內心的困惑。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:00 A.M. 野外某處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"已按照計畫進入十區，三點鐘方向發現敵人的蹤影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"......掃描完畢，可視範圍內共三人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才逃往十區的還剩下四人。現在在這裡殲滅敵人，就可以防止對方將作戰情報帶回給其他人，對我們第二次正式進攻十分有利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這三個人......絕不能讓他們逃走了，還要找出第四個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去牽制住他們！大家就按計畫執行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"按照......計畫？芬隊長，我應該做些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咦？我又忘記說明了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖，你找到制高點進行援護射擊，幫忙排除多餘風險。霜葉，跟在我身後，抓住敵人後立即進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏡頭繼續確保全場視野，還有，務必保護好稀音的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"是，目前確認鏡頭的複合隱蔽防禦並未被敵方察覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這個燒焦的氣味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第四人設下的埋伏！果然，他們不僅僅是撤退，還想用詭計引我們中招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖，拜託你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是讓我引爆埋伏的意思嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在我左側的位置，你對付陷阱，霜葉和我去捉住剩下的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，瞧我的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":true,"text":"等等......芬隊長，目標超出我的攻擊範圍了，我換個位置——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，酸糖更擅長的是高精度的近距離射擊，剛才的位置超出了她的攻擊射程。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是我習慣性地設想成了克洛絲的攻擊模式......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"芬隊長，第四個人......第四個人不在前面，在後面——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......是埋伏襲擊！隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，這是對付酸糖的陷阱——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......什麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖小姐，酸糖小姐，請作出回應。您的信號中斷了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，霜葉，你去支援酸糖，從陷阱位置撤離。我來找出第四個傢伙......不能讓他離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖，能聽到我說話嗎，酸糖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":true,"text":"芬隊長......我沒事，只是爆炸影響了通訊，咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了......混蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了。隊長，酸糖受傷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"只是輕傷而已，活動活動就沒問題了。放心，芬隊長，我還能作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以暫時撤退了。鏡頭，地圖上還有其他風險嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"十區已經完全安全了，並且撤離路線未發現有危險的跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，我沒事的。芬隊長，還有剛才那三個人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四人都已經解決了。我們的任務已經完成，確認十區危險狀況排除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就暫時撤退吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"十分鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖......你的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事......咳，真的沒事啦，芬隊長！滑板已經幫我擋下幾乎所有爆炸傷害了，只是跌倒蹭到了一點皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......竟然因為我的緣故，讓你受了傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明應該在十區穩健地完成區域勘察和殲滅，最終安全及時地撤離的。都怪我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長......？真的沒關係啦，你看，真的只是小傷而已，我還留著大部分力氣繼續參加下一階段的任務呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"其他小隊應該很快就會來會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的第一階段任務還是完成了，接下來就等待合流之後進行下一波的正式進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我太莽撞了。明明知道那個區域極有可能佈下陷阱，還是自己先衝了進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長你的判斷並沒有錯。只是在剛才的任務裡有些脫節，但是並沒有錯過一舉剿滅的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"當時只要配合一起進攻，雖然事後看來有些激進，我們的實力是足以擊敗對方的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也不是不明白芬隊長的想法啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才站在高處的時候，我能夠看到局面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長其實已經找到了對方的弱點，想直接速攻敵人吧？配以後方支援再注意解決陷阱，其實不會產生什麼風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我指揮的時候判斷失誤了。我下意識地......將隊員的作戰方式想成了自己更加熟悉的模擬狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明在任務開始前我已經記住了所有人的特長，在正式作戰裡卻還是用了習慣的思路，想當然地發出了不該由酸糖你承擔的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不僅如此，我並沒有清楚地將計畫傳達給隊員......害得大家要消耗更多的精力來完成任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不覺得剛才是芬隊長有錯。剛才的狀況下，芬隊長讓我負責處理陷阱，自己和霜葉去追擊敵人是很好的戰術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"只是沒有料到敵人在那個情況下還會想要反撲。實在是太不自量力啦，還不是被芬隊長你解決掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稀音","speakerId":"char_336_Scene","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"稀音小姐想說，其實芬隊長也很信任自己身邊的隊員，所以認為大家透過行動能夠領會自己的指令吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"每個隊長的行事風格有所不同。芬隊長有自己的擅長之處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也有些好奇。芬隊長說剛才的失誤是下意識用了習慣的模擬情況，具體是指什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概......是我在A1預備小隊裡的習慣。明明現在不是在小隊的模擬演習中，而是更重要的實戰現場......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，我到底在做什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稀音","speakerId":"char_336_Scene","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜冷靜，芬隊長。稀音小姐很擔心你太過自責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"放鬆啦，隊長。任務一還算順利地完成了，調整下情緒輕鬆起來吧？或者，有苦惱的話也可以說出來，我們現在是一個團隊嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"說起A1預備小隊......芬所在的預備小隊很熱鬧吧？一起訓練、一起進行模擬作戰，團隊協作能力肯定沒得說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們，酸糖，稀音，霜葉......還有鏡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上......我認為在團隊行動能力上，我所在的A1預備小隊一定不比別的預備小隊差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們相處了很長時間，大家已經能夠完全理解互相的思路和行動方式，有些反應僅憑默契就能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊。我看芬經常和米格魯、克洛絲待在一起，平時也是最好的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......我、米格魯和克洛絲在來到羅德島之前，曾在哥倫比亞的警備隊做過實習隊員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"真厲害啊。我在哥倫比亞的時候滿腦子只有滑板，來到羅德島後才發現，之前老警官教給我的弩的技術竟然派上了用場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"相比而言，我要比芬業餘太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，酸糖小姐現在已經十分適應戰場作戰的任務了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，是嗎。不過戰場受傷我也不是第一次了，總是容易大意地受傷，時常讓隊長們感到緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多積累些經驗就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在A1預備小隊的作戰裡，我和小隊成員們經歷了很多的訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在磨合的過程中，甚至摸索出了一套只有我們自己能夠理解的方便暗號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了她們的幫助，給了我能夠判斷形勢的時間和空間，所以才有了成為隊長進行指揮的機會。可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"可是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，今天是我第一次正式作為臨時小隊隊長進行指揮作戰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道為什麼，我無法將我的計畫和指揮調整到最好狀態......不僅讓大家沒有能夠理解我的指令，還安排給隊員不擅長的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......實在想不明白，除了自己能力不足外，到底還有哪裡出了問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稀音","speakerId":"char_336_Scene","isRemote":false,"text":"不會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可以這麼想呢，芬隊長！你剛才的反應和判斷完全沒錯啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"我和稀音看得很清楚，在剛才的戰場上，你對局勢的判斷已經十分準確。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠迅速在前線找到敵人的要害，非常勇敢地衝到前方為大家開路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是勇敢的話，在這個戰場上無論誰都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是勇敢而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霜葉......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"有些人生來就是戰士，聽從命令的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"會根據戰場情況進行思考判斷招式的變化，但是對於長官的命令會絕對服從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"但是芬，你不僅僅是戰士，也是指揮大家的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我真的能做好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。至少，你盡自己所能，讓我們的隊伍完成了第一次任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"還有啊，芬隊長你既能團結A1預備小隊的大家在戰場上獲得勝利，又能在生活中和大家相處融洽，是個很稱職的隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，也不是每個人都能幸運地在預備小隊裡互相扶持著成長。像我，因為太特立獨行了，想加入固定的小隊還不給這個機會呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神來嘛，芬隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"我們並不認為你下達了錯誤的命令，你只是想要做得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想要尋求改變，就從更多的實戰中總結失敗經驗。芬隊長一定能很快解決自己的問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會努力繼續履行好隊長的職責的。但是我還是希望趁這段時間，大家能夠對我的指揮提出一些自己的建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......大概，剛才我一下子沒明白芬隊長為什麼要衝上去，所以有些慌張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖小姐，這個歸類為“加強溝通”應該更加合適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，就是這個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加強溝通......務必讓小隊成員得到更加明確和清楚的指令......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。溝通很重要。芬的反應和行動很果斷，但是一定要確保大家能夠及時進行支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提前制定計劃，確保每個隊員的安全......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮作戰是最難、最關鍵的部分，芬小姐能夠成為隊長，實力是毋庸置疑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"希望芬隊長能夠更多鼓勵隊員，隊員也會始終信任隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"對了對了，平時A1預備小隊的大家除了一起訓練，都是怎麼增進感情的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，大概就是一起討論戰術和總結，平常就打打鬧鬧，聊聊天、吵吵架......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"吵吵架？真是有夠激烈的相處方式啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，像這種時候，都是我強制要求她們進行休息的，不然總是聊著天就忘記了休息時間......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"距離下次任務還有三十分鐘，大家也先休息一下吧。我會負責叫醒大家準時集合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？可是我還想聽芬隊長說更多有關預備小隊的故事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行，傷患更要好好休息，快點躺下，酸糖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，好啦，不過任務結束之後，芬隊長再給我講更多有趣的故事吧？我很感興趣嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稀音","speakerId":"char_336_Scene","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"稀音想問，您的心情已經恢復了嗎？希望剛才的交談對您有益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，稀音，鏡頭。只需要再稍微給我一些時間獨處，我還有思路需要調整。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。這樣就對了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"十五日前 羅德島訓練場內"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"……今天的訓練到此結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"終於結束了……呼哈……我已經不行啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲還是從來不放過任何休息的時間啊……還是聽我的建議，和我一起吃健康餐好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"會變得更加精神，作息也更有規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"不要啦——要有了像芙蓉一樣的自制力或許會變得更厲害……但是我還是想輕鬆一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"噓、噓，克洛絲，教官們都還在呢……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，不要讓格瑞斯教官看笑話，大家整隊一起出去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"芬。你留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"咿，好慘。做隊長的總是被留得更晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，芬的性格也不會反感多和教官交談幾句啦。有責任感又認真，像我完全不能接受比別人多訓練，可是芬……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然還有精力開心地搖起尾巴，芬還真是精神啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦，芬的情緒一直很好理解，訓練的時候也不會感到煩躁。哪裡像我們，對於持久作戰根本受不了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"明明想偷懶的就只有你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你們啊……！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"噗哈……那我們就先走啦，格瑞斯教官，芬隊長！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……抱歉，教官，讓您看到我們這副樣子。我們是不是太懶散了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"放輕鬆，你做得不差。這次讓你留下，不是因為A1預備小隊的事，而是關於你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己的事……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。芬，我曾在幾次和A1小隊成員的單獨談話中接收到一些資訊。有關於你作為隊長的擔憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……不想讓大家太擔心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"A1預備小隊全員的成長大家有目共睹。訓練期結束了之後，隊員們也將被派遣去其它臨時小隊進行更多的實戰任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，芬。身為隊長，你一直做得不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是……我卻很少單獨參加臨時小隊的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉、克洛絲和米格魯都已經順利地完成過臨時小隊的任務，而炎熔更是經常參與各種正式行動，獨當一面的實力有目共睹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而身為隊長的我，雖然履行著隊長的職責，卻也受著大家的保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明明知道這一點，有時還是會自私地想，如果能一直在A1小隊中擔任隊長也足夠了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我希望A1的大家能夠一直在一起，但大家也有自己必須要去做的事。所以……我明白，大家都是要向前邁進的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你的想法我也在和A1成員們的交談中瞭解過，她們也都知道你的責任心和心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，讓隊員們能夠為你疏導情緒也是很重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"身為前輩，我特別想要告訴你的是，羅德島的訓練成效不僅僅是用戰鬥能力評級的提升就能概括的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"杜賓教官一直希望，羅德島的幹員們不僅能有過人的實力和堅定的信念，還要有……不因戰場的殘酷而封閉自己的，一顆跳動的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都不能將自己視作戰場上的一顆棋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，芬，屬於你的機會會越來越多，不僅能讓羅德島信任你的實力，也能夠使你自己更加鮮活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我……更加鮮活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"小隊隊長可不是那麼好當的。A1預備小隊的成員認可了你的實力，也成為了你的知己與同伴，你們的默契旁人難以企及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"相信你自己，也要相信不論是哪支小隊的隊員，在共同的目標面前，即使存在不足，也一定有互相補全的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人不夠完美，兩人、三人……彙聚起來的力量，或許會有差異和分歧，但卻能在中心更加強大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直支持你再進一步，芬。去努力讓自己成為引領這份中心力量的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教官……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是。我，不會放棄的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長的責任和壓力可不是誰都能承擔和承受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"很好很好，相信自己，記住今天躍躍欲試的自己的心情吧，芬。你能夠做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……不過，格瑞斯教官……由你來說這些話……總覺得很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈……是不是和我平時風格不太像？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也沒有啦……只是，比平時又專業了很多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你是瞭解我的，也當然能猜到這些看法是誰真正想告訴你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不過嘛，即使“她”不主動告訴你這些，也還是希望能夠讓其他人帶給你信心和勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，快去休息吧。你的第一次單獨小隊隊長任務大概不久後就要指派來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會！我一定好好準備……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格瑞斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次誰都會有失誤的，可別怪我沒提醒你。到時候別在其他隊員面前哭啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不會呢！謝謝你，格瑞斯教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（也謝謝你……杜賓教官。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……差點就哭了，好丟臉。哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都在鼓勵我，我明明也一直相信的，我能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜賓教官，格瑞斯教官，我……好像能夠理解了。被隊員信任，被諒解是多麼沉重，也多麼令人欣慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是……隊長。想要一直成長，承擔更多隊長的職責，這是我自己決定的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"narration","text":"三十分鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三小隊集合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈......還好有時間短暫休息了一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稀音","speakerId":"char_336_Scene","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鏡頭","speakerId":"avg_npc_145","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然給予了休息時間，不過剛才芬隊長完全沒有閉眼呢。鏡頭拍了好多芬隊長認真翻閱作戰檔案和資料的認真表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這沒什麼特別的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二階段進攻行動將在二十分鐘後展開，我們會和第二小隊進行聯合進攻，再次從十區攻入，快速勘察地形並佔據有利位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"最先遇敵交戰的小隊嗎，這個工作可不輕鬆啊。不過正好適合我們來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"芬隊長，我們下一步的計畫是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，根據上一場交戰和勘察的情況，我修改了下作戰計畫書中的內容，現在配發到各位手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結合之前作戰的經驗，我認為還是更有進攻性的主動作戰更適合我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏡頭和稀音，務必保證自己的安全，資訊溝通無礙。前線小隊非常需要精確的地圖資訊和圖像資料傳輸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酸糖，依舊負責高處援助射擊。不需要太過分散，否則不容易進行支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酸糖","speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解！離敵人近一些，我的弩箭傷害更足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"霜葉，你和我對敵方部隊中心發動進攻。進入現場時以隱蔽狀態進行探索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鏡頭得到的地形資料需要以最快速度傳遞給第二小隊，對方會跟在我們身後立即趕來支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到突破敵方第一陣線，就立刻引導後續火力的跟進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事前戰術安排說明到此為止。在進入十區之後，務必聽從我的指令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才......很感謝大家對我的開導。第一次勘察突擊作戰因為我的緣故造成了隊員的受傷，接下來的戰場不會再有同樣的失誤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會再在指令和判斷上疏忽。所以，還請大家信任我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為隊長應該做什麼，我早就非常瞭解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在......全體人員，進行出發前最後一次隨身裝備檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"avg_123_fang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"發現敵方單位。準備作戰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["？？？"]},{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_122_beagle","aliases":["米格魯"]},{"speakerId":"char_124_kroos","aliases":["克洛絲"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_336_Scene","aliases":["稀音"]},{"speakerId":"char_366_acdrop","aliases":["酸糖"]}]}
